### stream.join — 방송 입장
POST http://localhost:8070/api/v1/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventType": "stream.join",
  "sessionId": "sess-test-001",
  "userId": "user-001",
  "userName": "jake",
  "deviceId": "device-uuid-abc",
  "roomId": "room-001",
  "osType": "android",
  "appVersion": "1.2.0",
  "utmSource": "instagram",
  "utmCampaign": "spring_sale",
  "utmMedium": "social",
  "properties": {
    "referrer": "https://instagram.com"
  }
}

###

### stream.leave — 방송 이탈
POST http://localhost:8070/api/v1/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventType": "stream.leave",
  "sessionId": "sess-test-001",
  "userId": "user-001",
  "roomId": "room-001",
  "osType": "android",
  "properties": {}
}

###

### stream.heartbeat — 시청 중 ping
POST http://localhost:8070/api/v1/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventType": "stream.heartbeat",
  "sessionId": "sess-test-001",
  "userId": "user-001",
  "roomId": "room-001",
  "osType": "ios",
  "properties": {
    "live_video_delay": 1.5,
    "muted": false,
    "background": false
  }
}

###

### product.click — 상품 클릭
POST http://localhost:8070/api/v1/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventType": "product.click",
  "sessionId": "sess-test-001",
  "userId": "user-001",
  "roomId": "room-001",
  "osType": "android",
  "properties": {
    "product_id": "P001",
    "product_name": "무선 이어폰",
    "price": 49000
  }
}

###

### product.purchase — 구매 완료
POST http://localhost:8070/api/v1/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventType": "product.purchase",
  "sessionId": "sess-test-001",
  "userId": "user-001",
  "roomId": "room-001",
  "osType": "android",
  "properties": {
    "product_id": "P001",
    "product_name": "무선 이어폰",
    "price": 49000,
    "quantity": 1,
    "total_amount": 49000,
    "order_id": "ORD-20260501-001"
  }
}

###

### chat.sent — 채팅 전송
POST http://localhost:8070/api/v1/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventType": "chat.sent",
  "sessionId": "sess-test-001",
  "userId": "user-001",
  "roomId": "room-001",
  "osType": "web",
  "properties": {
    "message_length": 12
  }
}

###

### validation 실패 케이스 — eventType 없음
POST http://localhost:8070/api/v1/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "sess-test-001",
  "roomId": "room-001"
}

###

### 비로그인 유저 — userId 없음
POST http://localhost:8070/api/v1/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventType": "stream.join",
  "sessionId": "sess-guest-001",
  "deviceId": "device-uuid-guest",
  "roomId": "room-001",
  "osType": "web",
  "properties": {}
}
